      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name}: It is impossible to download a \"future proof\" .unitypackage without being authenticated as the user who uploaded it. This does not make it easier for rippers to steal avatars, as the API will not return a download URL for anyone but the author.",
