  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-18T13:22:04.819Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the 2017 update, quite a few older avatars have to be reuploaded, due to issues with crunch compression or rotations. However, not everyone keeps their older avatars around.\n\nThe \"future-proof publish\" option in the SDK seems to upload a .unitypackage of your avatar. Apparently you can already recover this package through the API, but there is no official support for this.\n\nPlease add a button to the SDK to redownload future-proofed avatars.",
